WEBVTT

00:04:28.437 --> 00:04:31.586
which dramatically affect 
many people’s quality of life?

00:04:31.586 --> 00:04:34.408
Tension headaches and most secondary cases

00:04:34.408 --> 00:04:37.286
can be treated with 
over-the-counter pain medications,

00:04:37.286 --> 00:04:41.347
such as anti-inflammatory drugs 
that reduce cranial swelling.

00:04:41.347 --> 00:04:43.537
And many secondary headache triggers,

00:04:43.537 --> 00:04:44.967
like dehydration,

00:04:44.967 --> 00:04:45.928
eye strain,

00:04:45.928 --> 00:04:47.017
and stress,

00:04:47.017 --> 00:04:49.116
can be proactively avoided.

00:04:49.116 --> 00:04:51.989
Migraines and cluster headaches 
are more complicated,

00:04:51.989 --> 00:04:56.899
and we haven’t yet discovered reliable 
treatments that work for everyone.

00:04:56.899 --> 00:05:00.938
But thankfully, pharmacologists 
and neurologists are hard at work